  "label": "Stereotype associating armed robbers with danger and criminality",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that armed robbers are inherently dangerous and pose an existential threat to society, justifying extreme police responses. This stereotype is rooted in real-world media portrayals and public discourse that often sensationalize armed crime as a primary threat, which can lead to fear-mongering and support for aggressive law enforcement policies. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme’s framing of the scenario.",
